~ start
set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = true
if GlobalVariables.Instance.gaveAlingNeneng == true:
    => gave_already
Aling Shoneng: Magkano isang balut anak..?
- 15 Pesos po
	Aling Shoneng: Sige pabili ako isa lang... Salamat
	do GlobalVariables.Instance.GiveBalut(1)
	do QuestSystem.TriggerQuestAdvance("aling_shoneng_has_balut")
	set GlobalVariables.Instance.gaveAlingShoneng = true
	set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = false
=> END

~ gave_already
Aling Shoneng: Okay na ito anak... maglako ka nalang doon ulit..
set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = false
=> END

~ call
Hoy dito! Pabili ako niyan!
set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = false
=> END

~ no_balut
Aling Shoneng: Nasaan na ang nilalako mo na balut anak..?
set GlobalVariables.Instance.isTalking = false
=> END